Package: timeknit
Title: Report Chunk Execution Times While Knitting
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Colin", "Rundel", email = "cr173@duke.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A drop-in progress display for 'knitr', and therefore for 'Quarto'
    documents rendered with the knitr engine, that appends the elapsed execution
    time to each chunk's progress line and summarizes the slowest chunks when the
    document finishes. Includes helpers to set a project up and to report the
    current status.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports: 
    cli,
    knitr (>= 1.42),
    utils
Suggests: 
    jsonlite,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0),
    xfun
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
